  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"由 Serilum 開發的模組。用心製作。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>Smaller Nether Portals 是一款極簡風格的模組，允許建立較小的下界傳送門，具體尺寸為 1x2、1x3 和 2x2。<br><br></p>\n<p><strong>注意：</strong>目前 Minecraft 在使用較小傳送門進行傳送時存在一個「錯誤」，會將玩家放置在另一側傳送門的正下方。<strong>本模組可以偵測到此狀況</strong>，並將玩家傳送到傳送門前方。它會偵測下方的方塊，如果是<em>地獄岩、靈魂沙或空氣方塊</em>，它會將這些方塊替換為黑曜石以防止意外死亡。如有需要，它也會保留空氣間隙。</p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum 的 RPG 套件包\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>較小的傳送門：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/smaller-nether-portals/a.png\" alt=\"完整結構\" width=\"1423\" height=\"827\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>若希望如此，您可以省略角落的方塊：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/smaller-nether-portals/b.png\" alt=\"無角落\" width=\"1423\" height=\"827\"><br><br></p>\n<p><strong>在此範例中，模組偵測到使用較小傳送門後玩家位於地下，因此改為將玩家放置在傳送門前方：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/smaller-nether-portals/c.png\" alt=\"另一側位置修正\" width=\"1423\" height=\"827\"></strong></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"注意事項與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>只要下載來源仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內，您即可在任何整合包中自由使用本模組。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他任何事項，請前往&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 儲存庫</a>。感謝！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
